  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Sudan Hub Incubation Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Hub Members have agreed to form a consortium of humanitarian civil society organizations called South Sudan Hub, currently under incubation with support from the Start Network, with the collective commitment to enable a localised and community centric hub responding to needs defined by the affected community in South Sudan. Through a host selection process, the Hub members selected and agreed that CAFOD will be the Hosting Agency  from 1 October 2024 to December 2026 . The role of the Host Agency is to provide the operational , coordinating and administrative functions necessary to deliver the activities and/or programmes on behalf of the Hub. The host agency will apply its own administrative procedures in hub operations and functions, as applicable, in accordance with any Hub Leadership Team guidelines and as required by specific grant agreements.</narrative>
  </description>
